  "notes": "Highlights\r\n- Novel multiphysics modeling of Nafion membranes for water electrolysis in green hydrogen production.\r\n- Electro-chemo-hydro-mechanical model based on the Theory of Porous Media, solved monolithically via finite elements.\r\n- Numerical results replicate membrane behavior under operational conditions, capturing its complex interactions.\r\n- Open-source codes and data ensure reproducibility and transparency.",
